{"schemaVersion":1,"courseNo":119,"lessonId":"land/plateau-mock-pm/119-mock-pm-3","authored":true,"slides":[{"layout":"title","emoji":"🗄️","title":"午後模試 第3回","subtitle":"SQL は表を描く。IP は切れ目。","blocks":[]},{"emoji":"📒","title":"たとえ話から","blocks":[{"t":"analogy","icon":"📒","real":"名簿から「東支店だけ数えて」。","tech":"SQL は表への**依頼文**。"}]},{"emoji":"🧭","title":"考える順番","blocks":[{"t":"flow","steps":[{"label":"FROM","sub":"どの表"},{"label":"WHERE","sub":"どの行"},{"label":"SELECT","sub":"何を出す"}]}]},{"emoji":"🔢","title":"COUNT とは","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**COUNT(*)** = 行の数","sub":"条件に合う行を数える"}]},{"emoji":"🖼️","title":"表を想像する","blocks":[{"t":"callout","kind":"tip","text":"行に印を付けてから数える。\n**頭の中の表**がミスを減らす。"}]},{"emoji":"🔗","title":"INNER JOIN","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**INNER** = 両方に一致する行だけ","sub":"片方にしかない行は消える"}]},{"emoji":"🔗","title":"LEFT OUTER JOIN","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**LEFT OUTER** = 左は全部残す","sub":"右にない所は NULL"}]},{"emoji":"🌐","title":"IP の切れ目","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"**/n** = ネットワーク部のビット数","sub":"残りがホスト部（機器の番号）"}]},{"emoji":"🧮","title":"使えるホスト数","blocks":[{"t":"flow","steps":[{"label":"32 − n","sub":"ホスト部"},{"label":"2 の累乗","sub":"個数"},{"label":"− 2","sub":"使える数"}]}]},{"emoji":"📝","title":"−2 する理由","blocks":[{"t":"callout","kind":"memo","text":"全部 0 と全部 1 は予約。\n==個数 − 2== が使えるホスト。"}]},{"emoji":"✅","title":"確認","blocks":[{"t":"check","q":"192.168.5.0/26 の使えるホスト数は？","choices":["30","62","64","126"],"answer":1,"explain":"32−26=6。2⁶=64。64−2===62==。","hint":"ホスト部 → 2 の累乗 → 2 を引く。"}]},{"emoji":"🏁","title":"まとめ","blocks":[{"t":"bullets","items":["SQL は **FROM→WHERE→SELECT**","LEFT は左を残し NULL","ホスト数は **2^(32−n) − 2**"]}]}]}